          "targetDoi": "10.2172/6301116",
          "snippet": "Mass separation is achieved in a 90\" C magnet with a gap of 10 cm and a bending radius of p = 1.6 m with normal entrance and exit angles. Detailed information about the magnet can be found in [4]. Field clamps have been installed at the entrance and exit of the magnet to define the fringing field region.",
