      "abstract": "Colloidal microspheres in optical tweezers are model systems for mesoscopic particles in conservative harmonic potentials and are used to realize micrometer-sized heat engines. While nonconservative forces and hydrodynamic flows that dissipate energy input by them are known to exist, their effect on...",
